{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"11:47 pm - As the Tiefling stepped a single foot onto her airship, she felt the wight of the day's adventures lift. Her knees buckled slightly and she collapsed to the deck, laying there for a few seconds before shakily getting up again. Pressing herself against the wall for support, she slowly, and painfully, began making her way to her quarters.\n\n11:50 pm - Soon she found herself in her quarters. She removed the now filthy robes, washed off, and went through her pre-bed routine. She lit some incense, pulled back her hair, and changed into a more causal sleep outfit she used for sleep. She then collapsed onto her bed.\n\n11:55 pm - Secel tossed, turned, and eventually, gave up chasing sleep. She was still running an adrenaline high. The thrill of combat, the exhilaration of staving off Death's grasp, the feeling of triumph, it all kept her from sleep. She sat up, putting out the incense and getting up. Changing into a new set of robes, she made her way out to <#863362543585329162> to clear her head.","created_at":"2021-07-13T07:58:05.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864415374282981377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Soon enough the cleric made her way to her quarters once more. This time, she simply flopped onto the bed and laid there until sleep overtook her.","created_at":"2021-07-13T09:07:20.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864432801990180885","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
