{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"<@468162764586876949> Hello! Your long rest is over now, have a great new day in Empire City!","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:11:18.928000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864554598491881483","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"10:11 am - Secel, eventually physically rolling out of bed and crashing onto the floor, woke up. She pressed her hand to her forehead, shaking her head slightly to clear the fogginess of waking up. With a grunt, she got to her feet, and made herself presentable for the day. \n\n10:18 am - Before she left, she did her morning prayer to Athena. A simple prayer in Celestial, basically wishing to have a day of good health, and that those who she met in the sewers and on the dock have a day of good health and safety. She then walked out onto <#863362543585329162>.","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:19:24.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864556636290547743","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Secel, while not tired, was worse: bored. Walking into her airship, she did a prayer to Athena before changing into street clothes and moving to the open air, continuing to watch the stars.","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:19:50.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864722840342233138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"The Tiefling dropped off all but her holy symbol which never left her neck unless necessary and her money. She stowed the Mace given to her by the amazing Meorys in her room before exiting the airship.","created_at":"2021-07-14T04:56:01.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864731944108556299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"The full phrase now says \"Kill the damn murder goose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T07:59:39.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864778156007227392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Secel walked in, and, only when she was in her quarters, let the emotional floodgates crumble. She collapsed onto the ground as she began sobbing. She was familiar with emotions, certainly, but not like this. Never had she felt something like this.\n\nThe feelings of weakness, both physically and mentally, made her feel small and helpless. The embarrassment at looking like a weakling, like a child, like a failure, made her cry. The feeling of embarrassment at making herself look like an idiot forced a scream from her lips, but the sound only came out as little more than a choked off yell as she continued to cry. The fact that she hadn't done the smart thing and declined made her feel like an even bigger idiot then she already did. \n\nThen came dark thoughts. To anyone else, it wouldn't seem like anything was wrong. But to Secel, all she could imagine was laughter. The laughter of the fiends she had heard stories of while growing up. This only made her cry even more, curling so tightly she was actually feeling the pressure of her knees on her chest. \n\n\"No! Leave me alone!\" She tried to yell out, to get them to leave her alone! But the words came out little more than a whisper. \"Let me suffer in peace! Is it not enough for me to feel like a failure? Like a weakling?\"\n\nThere was no reply from he laughter. Eventually, she began to cry herself to sleep. But by this point, her eyes were so dry, there were no more tears to weep. She weakly reached for her pillow, eventually pulling it down and moving her head onto it. Then came the blanket, which only served to feed the feeling of physical weakness. Draping the blanket over herself, she grabbed hold of her necklace, and prayed to Athena for protection as she slept.\n\nSoon enough, she fell asleep...","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:14:22.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864781860944478248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
