{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She nodded at Sabrine. “I just.. naturally switch to Infernal. I never thought a non Fiend-born would understand…” She went quiet, then brushed her hair back.","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:42:46.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166495909806101","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'Ah, well... It was only... by virtue of my Guide. I alone... do not understand... unless this is a dialect?' (deep speech) ||But I do not know how I know this, either.||","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:43:30.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865166681335660554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She gave a small shrug, then looked at Johnathan. “May I know why you care for me?”","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:45:19.625000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865167137571995668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"\"Well I care quite a lot about others well being, my Godmother said it was a trait I shared with my father, however on a more personal note I am glad to meet another follower of Athena out here, and I would do anything to help a kindred spirit\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:48:36.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865167962180681738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She nodded, and looked at Sabrine. “How about you, Sabrine?”","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:49:35.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865168209413668864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I may share... some experiences. Occasionally... when I rest... strange images... strange voices flicker... through my head.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:50:47.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865168512476774440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"she switches to telepathy for simplicity. ||For clarity - I do not sleep, I merely meditate, but recently more and more I have had strangeness interfering. Over the last few months, it was very little when I originally... ah, revived... but I do not remember much from that time. And now, it is more, but I retain more memories.||","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:52:30.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865168946084839444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She once again nodded, then curled her fingers around her other hand. “I…” She bit her lip, then started again. “After I used my… ‘gift’, I heard a voice whisper in my ear, wanting me to… to give in and finish the kill…”","created_at":"2021-07-15T09:55:42.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865169750535438357","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
